  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID/Democratic Republic of the Congo Funded Counter Trafficking in Persons Activity (C-TIP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this project is to promote a more coordinated and effective national response to combat trafficking in persons. The project aims to achieve intermediate results including increased investigation and prosecution of traffickers; increased capacity of new agency to fulfil mandate; and increased protection for victims of trafficking.</narrative>
  </description>
